{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45575","headline":"长安道 · 贯休","name":"长安道","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"憧憧合合，八表一辙。\n黄尘雾合，车马火热。\n名汤风雨，利辗霜雪。\n千车万驮，半宿关月。\n上有尧禹，下有夔卨。\n紫气银轮兮，常覆金阙。\n仙掌捧日兮，浊河澄澈。\n愚将草木兮有言，与华封人兮不别。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45575.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45575","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}